        "id": 5046
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-07-17T04:15:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When we have project or domain scoped federated tokens, groups are not included in the response. The groups are only returned in the response when we are getting an unscoped federated token. \n\nI believe if we remove the conditional here we will be exposing groups for all federated token responses (unscoped, domain-scoped, and project-scoped), even if it is just an empty list, which isn\u0027t what we do today. I think Marek has a follow on patch for asserting group IDs in responses where we expect an unscoped federated token and vice versa for project and domain scoped federated tokens.",
      "parentUuid": "9a41bdd9_eb330f61",
      "revId": "913554e9103fa889615bf25b278ec59e011b0eee",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
